        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I feel certain that this falls into the &quot;stupid question&quot; category, but ...</p><p>On the &quot;Radical Peacemonger&quot; side of Deadline&#39;s rules card, it states that if there are three or more catastrophe cards in play, flip him. &quot;Otherwise play the top card of the villain deck&quot;.</p><p>So, just to clarify, if he is in Radical Peacemonger mode, with less than three catastrophes, Deadline plays two villain deck cards per turn? One for his &quot;play&quot; phase, called for by the game rules, and one at the end of the turn per his rules text?</p><p>Thanks,</p><p>BLM</p>",
